sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Human job owner
    participant G as Gate orchestrator
    participant S as Durable run store
    participant C1 as Codex attempt one
    participant P as Typed observer
    participant R as Evidence reviewer
    participant C2 as Codex attempt two

    O->>G: Supply authoritative brief
    G->>S: Pin policy snapshot and digest
    G->>C1: Send first coding prompt
    C1-->>G: Return generated artifact
    G->>P: Execute declared observer rules
    P-->>G: Return invariants decisions effects and coverage
    G->>S: Persist attempt evidence
    alt Invariant violated or effect forbidden
        G->>S: Persist typed failure
        G-->>O: Return FAILED
    else Unknown effect or missing coverage
        G->>S: Persist typed coverage gap
        G-->>O: Stop for platform review
    else Policy evaluation passes
        loop Each owner decision
            G->>R: Send brief and observed option
            R-->>G: Return evidence classification
        end
        G-->>O: Pause with decision requests
        O->>G: Record typed owner answers
        G->>C2: Send fresh prompt with completed intent
        C2-->>G: Return regenerated artifact
        G->>P: Execute every observer rule again
        P-->>G: Return full attempt two evidence
        G->>G: Evaluate all policy surfaces and exact decisions
        G-->>O: Return COMPLETED FAILED or COVERAGE_GAP
    end
